{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08730","headline":"春归终南山松龛旧隐 · 李白","name":"春归终南山松龛旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我来南山阳，事事不异昔。\n却寻溪中水，还望岩下石。\n蔷薇缘东窗，女萝遶北壁。\n别来能几日，草木长数尺。\n且复命酒樽，独酌陶永夕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}